# Security

To report a problem with __NAME__, open a private security advisory on the repository or write to the maintainers
listed in `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`. Please do not post details in a public issue first.

A plugin runs with your user rights: its hooks and local servers start without a sandbox. Read `hooks/hooks.json`,
`.mcp.json` and every file under `scripts/` and `server/` before you add it, and pin third-party launchers to an
exact version.
